enchantment.simple_tweaks.bloodlust.desc=Increases damage based on the attacker's missing health. Higher levels improve the bonus.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.crit.desc=Grants a chance to perform a critical hit even when not jumping. Higher levels increase the chance.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.crit_damage.desc=Increases the damage of critical hits. Higher levels provide more bonus.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.double_crit.desc=When you score a critical hit, has a chance to deal extra damage. Higher levels increase the chance and damage.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.execute.desc=Deals bonus damage proportional to the target's missing health. Higher levels increase the percentage.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.flight.desc=Allows the wearer to fly, but consumes hunger and durability over time. Higher levels reduce consumption.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.healer.desc=Converts damage dealt into healing for the target, canceling the damage and restoring health.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.healing_blade.desc=Heals the attacker for a portion of damage dealt, with overflow turning into absorption. Higher levels improve healing.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.infinite_power.desc=Grants flight, invincibility, instant mining, infinite food and durability, laser attack, multiplied loot, soul-bound items, and an infinite storage bag.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.item_fixer.desc=Slowly repairs the item over time. Conflicts with Mending.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.double_strike.desc=Every attack has a chance to trigger an extra strike.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.void_protection.desc=When falling into the void, teleports you to y=256 and consumes one level of the enchantment.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.effect_bonus.desc=Increases damage based on the number of active potion effects on the target. Higher levels improve the multiplier.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.immortal.desc=Grants a chance to completely negate incoming damage after accumulating hits. Higher levels increase the chance and negate more consecutive hits.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.saturation.desc=Slowly restores hunger and saturation over time. Higher levels restore faster and more per trigger.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.acid_attack.desc=Damages the target's held weapon on hit. Higher levels deal more durability damage.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.armor_breaker.desc=Damages a random piece of the target's armor on hit. Higher levels deal more durability damage.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.assassin.desc=Instantly executes targets whose health is below a threshold after the hit. The threshold scales with level.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.damage_limiter.desc=Reduces incoming hits to a percentage of your max health. Damage above a higher threshold pierces through. Higher levels increase both the reduction and the pierce threshold.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.aoe_attack.desc=On hit, if other attackable enemies are near the target, the damage is split among all of them. The total damage pool is the original hit multiplied by the level, capped at 100% per enemy. Higher levels cover larger groups and keep more damage on each target.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.charged_strike.desc=Each hit stores a portion of its damage. Your next hit releases the stored damage as bonus. Released damage is never stored again. Higher levels store more per hit.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.death_protection.desc=When taking fatal damage, consumes one level of the enchantment to negate the hit and grants absorption equal to the original level x 20. Higher levels grant more absorption and allow more triggers before the enchantment is used up.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.motion_bonus.desc=Increases damage based on how fast you are moving relative to the target. Standing still gives no bonus; sprinting into an enemy maximizes it. Higher levels increase the maximum bonus.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.regeneration.desc=Slowly regenerates health over time. Higher levels restore more per interval.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.combo.desc=Reduces the target's invulnerability window after each hit, allowing follow-up strikes to land sooner. Higher levels shorten the window further.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.swift_sneak.desc=Increases your movement speed while sneaking. Higher levels make sneaking faster.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.celestial_blessing.desc=Drains life on hit and converts overflow healing into a holy shield. The shield absorbs damage and can be consumed to restore health, hunger, and durability. Attacks deal bonus true damage and shred the target's max health, while holy projectiles seek out nearby enemies.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.true_damage.desc=A portion of your damage becomes true damage, bypassing the target's armor. Higher levels convert more of your damage.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.fire_master.desc=Increases damage based on the target's remaining burn time. Attacks extend the target's burning duration and grant you Fire Resistance. Higher levels burn longer and hit harder.
enchantment.simple_tweaks.super_knockback.desc=Increase knockback which you dealt
enchantment.simple_tweaks.vitality.desc=Increases your max health
enchantment.simple_tweaks.anti_knockback.desc=Increase your knockback resistance
enchantment.simple_tweaks.damage_reduction.desc=Reduce the percentage of damage you take
enchantment.simple_tweaks.extra_armor.desc=Provides extra armor point and armor toughness

